---
export const prerender = true;
import MainLayout from "~/app/layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { getMetadata } from "~/lib/constants";

const { name, links } = getMetadata("en");
const lastUpdated = "March 18, 2025";
---

<MainLayout
  title={"Privacy Policy"}
  description="Information about how we collect, use and protect your personal data."
>
  <main class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 xl:px-10 py-20">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
      >
        ← Back to home
      </a>
    </div>

    <article class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        At <strong>{name}</strong> we take the privacy of our users very
        seriously. This policy explains what personal data we collect, for what
        purpose and how we protect it, in accordance with the General Data
        Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>

      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Name:</strong> {name}</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <a href={links.email}>{links.email.replace("mailto:", "")}</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website:</strong>
          <a href={links.website} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >{links.website}</a
          >
        </li>
        <li><strong>Location:</strong> Barcelona, Spain</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact data:</strong> name, email address, phone number and
          message, when you provide them voluntarily through the contact form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited
          and time spent, collected anonymously via technical and analytical
          cookies.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Purpose of processing</h2>
      <p>We use your data to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your enquiries and quote requests.</li>
        <li>
          Manage the commercial relationship arising from the provision of our
          services.
        </li>
        <li>
          Send you information about our services, if you have given your
          express consent.
        </li>
        <li>Improve the performance and user experience of the website.</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Legal basis for processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Performance of a contract</strong> or application of
          pre-contractual measures.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent</strong> of the data subject (contact form,
          subscriptions).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Legitimate interest</strong> in improving our services and
          communications.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Compliance with legal obligations.</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We will retain your data for as long as necessary for the purpose for
        which it was collected or while a contractual relationship exists, and
        in any case for the periods established by applicable legislation.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Recipients of data</h2>
      <p>
        We do not transfer your data to third parties, except where legally
        required or necessary for the provision of the service (e.g. hosting
        providers or communication tools). All providers have adequate data
        protection guarantees.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may exercise the following rights at any time by contacting us at{
          " "
        }
        <a href={links.email}>{links.email.replace("mailto:", "")}</a>:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> know what data we process about you.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> request deletion of your data.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Objection:</strong> object to the processing of your data.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Restriction:</strong> request restriction of processing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Portability:</strong> receive your data in a structured format.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the relevant
        supervisory authority in your country.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We adopt appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect
        your data against unauthorised access, loss, alteration or disclosure.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to update this policy at any time. The current
        version will always be available on this page with the date of the last
        update.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any queries related to this privacy policy, you can contact us at <a
          href={links.email}>{links.email.replace("mailto:", "")}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

